 "description": "Spends credits. Runs a quote from quote_llc_owner_lookup and returns the company's officers or managers, registered agent and formation details. Charges only if the company is found, never more than the quote. A company that is not found costs nothing. Call only after the user agreed to the quoted cost. A quote runs once and expires after 10 minutes.",
